{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A friendship tested by endless chaos...</strong><br><strong> A high-difficulty 2-player parking game where communication is everything!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Have a blast with friends in chaotic, high-stakes parking!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.poster.avif?t=1757913898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.webm?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.mp4?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend have one simple goal... &quot;park&quot; the car!<br>But be warned... this is no ordinary parking job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97<strong>One hit and it's over!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.poster.avif?t=1757913898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.webm?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.mp4?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any collision means an instant explosion! Communicate clearly and give directions to survive the heart-pounding tension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97<strong>You age outside the car!?</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.poster.avif?t=1757913898\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.webm?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.mp4?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside, and the aging timer starts ticking down! (And we all know what happens in the end...)Your time on foot is limited, so divide your tasks wisely and work together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1757913898\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1757913898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br><br><i>*Communication between players is essential for this game. We highly recommend using a voice chat service, as there is no in-game voice chat feature. Please consider this before purchasing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i><br><br><i>*We welcome streams, broadcasts, and video content created by individual players. Monetization through partner programs such as those on YouTube and Twitch is also